{"title": "Seldom Caught Unawares (+2)", "pageid": 27929, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Seldom_Caught_Unawares_(+2)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Seldom_Caught_Unawares_(%2B1)\" title=\"Seldom Caught Unawares (+1)\">Seldom Caught Unawares (+1)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Seldom Caught Unawares</b> is a passive feature that grants a bonus to initiative rolls.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain a +2 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/25px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/38px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/50px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Initiative rolls\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/25px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative rolls</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soulbreaker_Greatsword\" title=\"Soulbreaker Greatsword\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Soulbreaker_Greatsword\" title=\"Soulbreaker Greatsword\">Soulbreaker Greatsword</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Enamelled_Armour\" title=\"Flame Enamelled Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Half_Plate_Armour_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Half_Plate_Armour_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Half_Plate_Armour_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Half_Plate_Armour_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Half_Plate_Armour_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Half_Plate_Armour_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Half_Plate_Armour_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Half_Plate_Armour_Flaming_Fist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a